[9.807934, "o", "🦥 Gemma via llama-server: 4.8s. Nothing left this machine.\r\n\r\nfix(cli): add GPA calculation fix\r\n\r\n- Fixed a potential error in the GPA calculation by adding a check for\r\n  unknown grades and raising an UnknownGradeError\r\n- Implemented a check to ensure grades are valid before calculating GPA\r\n\r\n"]
[9.812217, "o", "[main d1b12aa] fix(cli): add GPA calculation fix\r\n 2 files changed, 13 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)\r\n"]
